    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "this that cometh from Edom, with dyed garments from Bozrah? this",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "glorious in his apparel, travelling in the greatness of his strength? I that speak in righteousness, mighty to save.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art thou",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "red in thine apparel, and thy garments like him that treadeth in the winefat?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have trodden the winepress alone; and of the people",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none with me: for I will tread them in mine anger, and trample them in my fury; and their blood shall be sprinkled upon my garments, and I will stain all my raiment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the day of vengeance",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in mine heart, and the year of my redeemed is come.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I looked, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none to help; and I wondered that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none to uphold: therefore mine own arm brought salvation unto me; and my fury, it upheld me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will tread down the people in mine anger, and make them drunk in my fury, and I will bring down their strength to the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ I will mention the lovingkindnesses of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the praises of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", according to all that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath bestowed on us, and the great goodness toward the house of Israel, which he hath bestowed on them according to his mercies, and according to the multitude of his lovingkindnesses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he said, Surely they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my people, children",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will not lie: so he was their Saviour.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In all their affliction he was afflicted, and the angel of his presence saved them: in his love and in his pity he redeemed them; and he bare them, and carried them all the days of old.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ But they rebelled, and vexed his holy Spirit: therefore he was turned to be their enemy,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he fought against them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he remembered the days of old, Moses,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his people,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "saying",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he that brought them up out of the sea with the shepherd of his flock? where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he that put his holy Spirit within him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That led",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "by the right hand of Moses with his glorious arm, dividing the water before them, to make himself an everlasting name?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That led them through the deep, as an horse in the wilderness,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they should not stumble?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As a beast goeth down into the valley, the Spirit of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "caused him to rest: so didst thou lead thy people, to make thyself a glorious name.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Look down from heaven, and behold from the habitation of thy holiness and of thy glory: where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.63.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.63.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
